	help
	  Say Y here if you want to enable support for the NOVATEK NT36672C
	  MIPI-DSI video mode panel with a resolution of 1080x2408.
	  This type of panel is mainly found on mobile phones.

config DRM_PANEL_EBBG_FT8719
	tristate "EBBG FT8719 panel driver"
	depends on OF

